/runs/25/#testresult/e4edf925580d67fa","status":"passed","time":{"start":1795041758000,"stop":1795042125340,"duration":367340}},{"uid":"19bac603e9cda8b3","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/23/#testresult/19bac603e9cda8b3","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794956802000,"stop":1794957297240,"duration":495240}},{"uid":"f9245f2489dca678","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/21/#testresult/f9245f2489dca678","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794868934000,"stop":1794869343160,"duration":409160}},{"uid":"8120ef7976665107","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/20/#testresult/8120ef7976665107","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794783244000,"stop":1794783539100,"duration":295100}},{"uid":"8452c3a5df720e1a","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/17/#testresult/8452c3a5df720e1a","status":"failed","statusDetails":"BuildImage \"lfedge/eve:0.0.0-master-368a44a3-kvm-amd64\" failed: rpc error: code = Unknown desc = failed to build EVE image for device \"edge-dev\": expected EVE image file \"/root/.evetest/images/templates/.tmp-cc0ae86c2c6ed8b07af04bc300f9d9a9-825140533/installer.raw.qcow2\" not found: stat /root/.evetest/images/templates/.tmp-cc0ae86c2c6ed8b07af04bc300f9d9a9-825140533/installer.raw.qcow2: no such file or directory\n\nClaude's conclusion:\n### Root cause\n\nThe failure is a disk-space exhaustion on the evetest broker host, not a device/SDN runtime issue — in fact no EVE device was ever provisioned for this step (`evetest status` confirms \"No EVE devices found\"). The broker log shows it was building a fresh \"installer\" image template (`Building EVE image template \"cc0ae86c2c6ed8b07af04bc300f9d9a9\"`, an 8192 MiB installer.raw image with partitions `efi conf_win installer inventory_win`), and the underlying `make-raw`/`mkfs.fat` step failed partway through writing the EFI partition image with `dd: error writing '/tmp/output.img': No space left on device`, so `installer.raw.qcow2` was never produced — exactly matching the \"file not found\" error surfaced up through `prepareImageForEVEDevice`.\n\nThis is distinct from the two preceding subtests in the same run (`TestBootstrapWithLastResortDisabled`/`Enabled`), which succeeded because they reused an already-cached EVE image template rather than building a new large installer image; only this third subtest needed to build the large fresh installer image, which is what triggered the broker's `/tmp` running out of space.\n\nI found no earlier occurrence of this \"No space left on device\"/\"make-raw failed\" signature anywhere in `live-ledger.md`, so this appears to be a new, not-previously-recorded issue (not a repeat of a known failure mode) — likely transient broker-host disk pressure (possibly from accumulated image-template caches) rather than a code defect in EVE itself. The broker host's own filesystem isn't reachable from this sandbox to confirm current free space directly, but the live build-log evidence is unambiguous about the proximate cause.","time":{"start":1794609711000,"stop":1794609795830,"duration":84830}},{"uid":"f17182d3356f8e4","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/16/#testresult/f17182d3356f8e4","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794522548000,"stop":1794522898900,"duration":350900}},{"uid":"c0558a6596919d5a","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/15/#testresult/c0558a6596919d5a","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794434645000,"stop":1794434929440,"duration":284440}},{"uid":"6dbeee501bf1636a","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/14/#testresult/6dbeee501bf1636a","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794348163000,"stop":1794348456550,"duration":293550}},{"uid":"7246338f757ee8b2","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/13/#testresult/7246338f757ee8b2","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794265721000,"stop":1794266002590,"duration":281590}},{"uid":"aa7113eb77e73d4a","reportUrl":"https://lf-e